  "claim_short": "1901.04450 Butzer Stens third Robin boundary value exterior ball approximation open problem. For every nonresonant real alpha,beta, the Robin boundary trace multiplier b_n(t)=exp(-nt)(alpha-beta n exp(-t))/(alpha-beta n) has error uniformly comparable for small t to 1-exp(-nt). Hence ||(I-V_t)h|| is equivalent to the Poisson error and K(t,h;L2,D(N)), giving exact direct/inverse rates, O(t) iff h in D(N), o(t) iff...",
